        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Justice, The Revelation, Extreme Rules (2011)\n- Companies: WWE\n- Places: St. Pete Times Forum, Tampa, Florida\n- Topics: professional wrestling pay-per-view events\n\nFacts:\n- On May 1, 2011, WWE produced Extreme Rules (2011), a professional wrestling pay-per-view event at the St. Pete Times Forum in Tampa, Florida.\n- The song \"Justice\" was used for WWE's Extreme Rules (2011).\n- The Revelation is Rev Theory's first full-length studio album since Justice.",
